  "text": " Conversation 9B. Plans for the Very Near Future. What are you doing tomorrow? I'm going to the beach with my family for a week. We're leaving early, at 6 a.m. Oh, nice. So I guess you're planning to go to bed early tonight. Yeah, I'm gonna pack my bag and try to hit the sack by 9 o'clock. Good luck with that. What are you taking? I always pack light for the beach. A bathing suit, a couple of pairs of shorts, some T-shirts, a hat, and lots of sunscreen. How about you? What are you doing next week? I'm going to stay home and catch up on some unfinished projects. Like what? Oh, I have a long list. First, I'm going to clean up my office, pay bills, write letters, and take care of a bunch of paperwork. Then I'm going to redecorate my bedroom, paint the walls, and get new curtains. Wow. What color are you going to paint it? It's a very light blue. I've already picked it out and bought the paint. Cool.",
